{"seq":3,"slug":"constraint-logic-programming","title":"约束逻辑编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/constraint-logic-programming","wordCount":1326,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束逻辑编程\">约束逻辑编程</h1><p>约束逻辑编程（Constraint Logic Programming, CLP）将 Prolog 的逻辑搜索与数学约束求解器结合，用声明式方式描述问题的约束条件，由求解器自动找到满足所有约束的解。CLP 不是对 Prolog 的替代，而是对其搜索能力的极大增强——将「生成再测试」转变为「约束再求解」，效率可提升数个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CLP 的核心思想可以用几个相互关联的概念来描述：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>约束存储</strong>（Constraint Store）：一组关于变量的域与关系，随着求解过程被不断收紧；</li>\n<li><strong>约束传播</strong>（Propagation）：当一个变量的域被缩减时，唤醒相关约束并重新计算其他变量的域，在搜索之前尽量排除不可能取值；</li>\n<li><strong>域</strong>（Domain）：CLP(FD) 的有限整数域、CLP(B) 的布尔域、CLP(Q/R) 的有理数/实数域；</li>\n<li><strong>标记</strong>（Labeling）：当传播不足以确定所有变量时，枚举剩余可能性的搜索阶段，其策略选择对性能影响巨大；</li>\n<li><strong>具体化</strong>（Reification）：把约束的真值转化为可合一的布尔值，使条件判断保持可双向推理。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>做什么</th>\n<th>关键收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>建模</td>\n<td>用约束声明问题</td>\n<td>程序贴近问题描述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传播</td>\n<td>由约束自动缩减域</td>\n<td>搜索空间被提前剪枝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标记</td>\n<td>枚举剩余可能</td>\n<td>只在必要时搜索</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"从-is-2-到约束-范式转换\">从 is/2 到约束：范式转换</h2><p>传统 Prolog 的算术运算 <code>is/2</code> 是单向的——右边的表达式必须在求值时完全确定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% is/2 的局限：单向求值&#10;?- X is 3 + 4.       % 成功：X = 7&#10;?- 7 is X + 4.       % 错误！X 未绑定&#10;?- 7 is 3 + X.       % 错误！X 未绑定\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% is/2 的局限：单向求值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X is 3 + 4.       % 成功：X = 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- 7 is X + 4.       % 错误！X 未绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- 7 is 3 + X.       % 错误！X 未绑定</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CLP 的约束操作符是<strong>关系式</strong>的——可以在任意方向推导：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\":- use_module(library(clpfd)).  % SWI-Prolog&#10;%% 或&#10;:- use_module(library(clpz)).   % Scryer Prolog&#10;&#10;?- X #= 3 + 4.       % X = 7&#10;?- 7 #= X + 4.       % X = 3（反向推导）&#10;?- 7 #= 3 + X.       % X = 4&#10;?- X + Y #= 7, X #&gt; Y, X #&gt; 0, Y #&gt; 0.&#10;%  X = 4, Y = 3 ; X = 5, Y = 2 ; X = 6, Y = 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(clpfd)).  % SWI-Prolog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 或</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(clpz)).   % Scryer Prolog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X #= 3 + 4.       % X = 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- 7 #= X + 4.       % X = 3（反向推导）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- 7 #= 3 + X.       % X = 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X + Y #= 7, X #> Y, X #> 0, Y #> 0.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%  X = 4, Y = 3 ; X = 5, Y = 2 ; X = 6, Y = 1</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"clp-的理论框架\">CLP 的理论框架</h2><p>CLP(X) 是一个参数化框架，X 指定约束域：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>域</th>\n<th>约束类型</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n<th>求解技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CLP(FD) / CLP(Z)</td>\n<td>有限域整数约束</td>\n<td>调度、排列、数独</td>\n<td>弧一致性 + 回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLP(B)</td>\n<td>布尔约束</td>\n<td>电路验证、SAT</td>\n<td>BDD / SAT 求解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLP(Q) / CLP(R)</td>\n<td>有理数/实数线性约束</td>\n<td>线性规划、几何</td>\n<td>单纯形法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>约束传播的核心思想是在搜索之前<strong>尽可能缩小变量域</strong>。每当一个变量的域被缩减，与之相关的所有约束被重新唤醒并传播：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>约束存储</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>新约束</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>传播</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>缩减后的约束存储</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{约束存储} + \\text{新约束} \\xrightarrow{\\text{传播}} \\text{缩减后的约束存储}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">约束存储</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新约束</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">传播</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">缩减后的约束存储</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;发布约束&lt;br/&gt;X in 1..9, Y in 1..9&lt;br/&gt;X + Y #= 10&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;弧一致性传播&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;X in 1..9&lt;br/&gt;Y in 1..9&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;添加 X #&gt; Y&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;再次传播&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;X in 6..9&lt;br/&gt;Y in 1..4&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;labeling&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;X=6,Y=4&lt;br/&gt;X=7,Y=3&lt;br/&gt;X=8,Y=2&lt;br/&gt;X=9,Y=1&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"发布约束&lt;br/&gt;X in 1..9, Y in 1..9&lt;br/&gt;X + Y #= 10\"] --&gt; B[\"弧一致性传播\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"X in 1..9&lt;br/&gt;Y in 1..9\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"添加 X #&gt; Y\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"再次传播\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"X in 6..9&lt;br/&gt;Y in 1..4\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"labeling\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"X=6,Y=4&lt;br/&gt;X=7,Y=3&lt;br/&gt;X=8,Y=2&lt;br/&gt;X=9,Y=1\"]</pre><h2 id=\"clp-fd-clp-z-实践\">CLP(FD)/CLP(Z) 实践</h2><h3 id=\"域声明与基本约束\">域声明与基本约束</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\":- use_module(library(clpfd)).&#10;&#10;%% 域声明&#10;?- X in 1..10.           % X 的域为 1 到 10&#10;?- X in 1..5 \\/ 8..10.  % X 的域为 {1,2,3,4,5,8,9,10}&#10;&#10;%% 算术约束&#10;?- X #= Y + Z.           % 等于&#10;?- X #\\= Y.              % 不等于&#10;?- X #&lt; Y.               % 小于&#10;?- X #=&lt; Y.              % 小于等于&#10;?- X #&gt; Y.               % 大于&#10;?- X #&gt;= Y.              % 大于等于\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(clpfd)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 域声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X in 1..10.           % X 的域为 1 到 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X in 1..5 \\/ 8..10.  % X 的域为 {1,2,3,4,5,8,9,10}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 算术约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X #= Y + Z.           % 等于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X #\\= Y.              % 不等于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X #&#x3C; Y.               % 小于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X #=&#x3C; Y.              % 小于等于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X #> Y.               % 大于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- X #>= Y.              % 大于等于</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"全局约束\">全局约束</h3><p>全局约束同时作用于多个变量，比等价的二元约束集合提供更强的传播：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% all_distinct：所有变量取不同值&#10;?- Vs = [X, Y, Z], Vs ins 1..3, all_distinct(Vs), label(Vs).&#10;%  生成所有排列&#10;&#10;%% element：数组索引约束&#10;?- element(I, [10, 20, 30, 40], V), V #&gt; 25.&#10;I in 3..4, V in 30..40.&#10;&#10;%% sum/3：加权和&#10;?- Vs = [X, Y, Z], Vs ins 0..1, sum(Vs, #=, 2).&#10;%  恰好两个为 1&#10;&#10;%% cumulative：资源调度&#10;tasks([task(0,3,1), task(1,2,2), task(3,1,1)], 2).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% all_distinct：所有变量取不同值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- Vs = [X, Y, Z], Vs ins 1..3, all_distinct(Vs), label(Vs).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%  生成所有排列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% element：数组索引约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- element(I, [10, 20, 30, 40], V), V #> 25.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>I in 3..4, V in 30..40.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% sum/3：加权和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- Vs = [X, Y, Z], Vs ins 0..1, sum(Vs, #=, 2).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%  恰好两个为 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% cumulative：资源调度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tasks([task(0,3,1), task(1,2,2), task(3,1,1)], 2).</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"n-皇后问题-clp-的经典展示\">N 皇后问题——CLP 的经典展示</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"n_queens(N, Qs) :-&#10;    length(Qs, N),&#10;    Qs ins 1..N,&#10;    safe_queens(Qs).&#10;&#10;safe_queens([]).&#10;safe_queens([Q|Qs]) :-&#10;    safe_queens(Qs, Q, 1),&#10;    safe_queens(Qs).&#10;&#10;safe_queens([], _, _).&#10;safe_queens([Q|Qs], Q0, D) :-&#10;    Q0 #\\= Q,&#10;    abs(Q0 - Q) #\\= D,&#10;    D1 #= D + 1,&#10;    safe_queens(Qs, Q0, D1).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>n_queens(N, Qs) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    length(Qs, N),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Qs ins 1..N,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    safe_queens(Qs).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safe_queens([]).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safe_queens([Q|Qs]) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    safe_queens(Qs, Q, 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    safe_queens(Qs).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safe_queens([], _, _).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>safe_queens([Q|Qs], Q0, D) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Q0 #\\= Q,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abs(Q0 - Q) #\\= D,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    D1 #= D + 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    safe_queens(Qs, Q0, D1).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比生成测试方式：8 皇后问题，生成测试需要检查 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>40320</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8! = 40320</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40320</span></span></span></span></span> 种排列；CLP 通过约束传播将搜索空间缩减到仅约 100 次回溯。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规模</th>\n<th>生成-测试节点数</th>\n<th>CLP 节点数</th>\n<th>加速比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>8 皇后</td>\n<td>~40,000</td>\n<td>~100</td>\n<td>400x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12 皇后</td>\n<td>~500,000,000</td>\n<td>~2,000</td>\n<td>250,000x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20 皇后</td>\n<td>不可行</td>\n<td>~50,000</td>\n<td>--</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"clp-b-布尔约束\">CLP(B)：布尔约束</h2><p>CLP(B) 处理布尔（0/1）变量上的约束，适用于电路设计、SAT 问题和组合覆盖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\":- use_module(library(clpb)).&#10;&#10;%% 布尔约束操作符&#10;%% + (OR), * (AND), # (XOR), ~ (NOT), =:= (等价)&#10;&#10;%% 电路验证：半加器&#10;half_adder(A, B, Sum, Carry) :-&#10;    sat(Sum =:= A # B),      % 异或&#10;    sat(Carry =:= A * B).    % 与&#10;&#10;?- half_adder(1, 1, S, C).&#10;S = 0, C = 1.&#10;&#10;%% 可满足性计数&#10;?- sat(X + Y + Z), sat_count(X + Y + Z, Count).&#10;Count = 7.  % 三变量至少一个为真的赋值数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>:- use_module(library(clpb)).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 布尔约束操作符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% + (OR), * (AND), # (XOR), ~ (NOT), =:= (等价)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 电路验证：半加器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>half_adder(A, B, Sum, Carry) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sat(Sum =:= A # B),      % 异或</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sat(Carry =:= A * B).    % 与</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- half_adder(1, 1, S, C).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S = 0, C = 1.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 可满足性计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- sat(X + Y + Z), sat_count(X + Y + Z, Count).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Count = 7.  % 三变量至少一个为真的赋值数</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"搜索策略-labeling-选项\">搜索策略：labeling 选项</h2><p>约束传播可能无法完全确定所有变量的值——此时需要<strong>标记</strong>（labeling）来枚举剩余的可能性。标记策略的选择对性能有巨大影响：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% labeling 选项&#10;?- Vs ins 1..100, all_distinct(Vs),&#10;   labeling([ff], Vs).           % first-fail：选域最小的变量&#10;&#10;%% 常用标记策略&#10;%% leftmost  — 从左到右（默认）&#10;%% ff        — first-fail，域最小优先&#10;%% ffc       — first-fail + 约束最多&#10;%% min/max   — 域最小值/最大值优先分裂&#10;%% bisect    — 二分域\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% labeling 选项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- Vs ins 1..100, all_distinct(Vs),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   labeling([ff], Vs).           % first-fail：选域最小的变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% 常用标记策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% leftmost  — 从左到右（默认）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% ff        — first-fail，域最小优先</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% ffc       — first-fail + 约束最多</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% min/max   — 域最小值/最大值优先分裂</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% bisect    — 二分域</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>leftmost</code></td>\n<td>按声明顺序</td>\n<td>简单问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ff</code></td>\n<td>域最小的变量先分支</td>\n<td>一般约束满足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ffc</code></td>\n<td>域小且参与约束多的优先</td>\n<td>密集约束网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>min</code>/<code>max</code></td>\n<td>取域端点</td>\n<td>优化问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bisect</code></td>\n<td>域中点分割</td>\n<td>大域问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"优化问题\">优化问题</h2><p>CLP(FD) 支持在满足所有约束的解中寻找最优解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 最小化目标&#10;?- Vs = [X, Y, Z], Vs ins 1..10,&#10;   X + Y + Z #= 15,&#10;   all_distinct(Vs),&#10;   Cost #= X * X + Y * Y + Z * Z,&#10;   labeling([min(Cost)], Vs).&#10;%  找到使 Cost 最小的赋值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 最小化目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>?- Vs = [X, Y, Z], Vs ins 1..10,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   X + Y + Z #= 15,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   all_distinct(Vs),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   Cost #= X * X + Y * Y + Z * Z,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   labeling([min(Cost)], Vs).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%  找到使 Cost 最小的赋值</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>labeling([min(Obj)], Vars)</code> 使用分支定界（branch-and-bound）策略：每找到一个解就将其目标值作为新的上界约束添加，逐步逼近最优。</p>\n<h2 id=\"约束与纯逻辑编程的统一\">约束与纯逻辑编程的统一</h2><p>CLP 的一个深刻洞察是：约束是对<a href=\"../foundations/search-strategies-cut\">搜索策略与剪枝</a>中讨论的朴素搜索的「智能剪枝」。传统 cut 是程序员手动修剪搜索树，而约束传播是求解器自动地、可证正确地缩减搜索空间。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"prolog\" data-code=\"%% 传统风格（带 cut 的过程式控制）&#10;classify(X, pos) :- X &gt; 0, !.&#10;classify(X, neg) :- X &lt; 0, !.&#10;classify(0, zero).&#10;&#10;%% CLP 风格（声明式约束）&#10;classify_clp(X, Class) :-&#10;    zcompare(Order, X, 0),&#10;    order_class(Order, Class).&#10;order_class(&lt;, neg).&#10;order_class(=, zero).&#10;order_class(&gt;, pos).\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>%% 传统风格（带 cut 的过程式控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>classify(X, pos) :- X > 0, !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>classify(X, neg) :- X &#x3C; 0, !.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>classify(0, zero).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>%% CLP 风格（声明式约束）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>classify_clp(X, Class) :-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    zcompare(Order, X, 0),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    order_class(Order, Class).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>order_class(&#x3C;, neg).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>order_class(=, zero).</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>order_class(>, pos).</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种从控制流到约束声明的转变，使程序保持了纯逻辑语义——可以在任意方向使用，也更容易被形式化验证。Scryer Prolog 的 <code>library(clpz)</code> 和 <code>library(reif)</code> 系统性地推广了这种风格，将条件判断具体化为可约束的布尔值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>约束逻辑编程把「搜索」从程序员的负担变成求解器的工作，本文要点如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>is/2</code> 是单向求值，<code>#=</code> 等约束操作符是关系式的，可在任意方向推导；</li>\n<li>CLP(X) 由域参数化，CLP(FD/Z)、CLP(B)、CLP(Q/R) 分别对应整数、布尔与实数域；</li>\n<li>约束传播在搜索前缩减变量域，是 CLP 相对「生成-测试」性能优势的根源；</li>\n<li>全局约束（<code>all_distinct</code>、<code>element</code>、<code>cumulative</code> 等）比等价的二元约束提供更强的传播；</li>\n<li>labeling 策略（<code>ff</code>、<code>ffc</code>、<code>bisect</code>、<code>min(Cost)</code>）的选择对性能影响巨大，需按问题特征选择；</li>\n<li><code>labeling([min(Obj)])</code> 的分支定界与 <code>zcompare</code>/<code>if_/3</code> 的具体化风格，让优化与条件判断都保持声明式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CLP 也可以与<a href=\"../foundations/search-strategies-cut\">搜索策略与剪枝</a>中的技术协同使用：约束负责自动剪枝，cut 则用于处理求解器无法表达的确定性控制。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束逻辑编程","id":"约束逻辑编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 is/2 到约束：范式转换","id":"从-is-2-到约束-范式转换"},{"level":2,"text":"CLP 的理论框架","id":"clp-的理论框架"},{"level":2,"text":"CLP(FD)/CLP(Z) 实践","id":"clp-fd-clp-z-实践"},{"level":3,"text":"域声明与基本约束","id":"域声明与基本约束"},{"level":3,"text":"全局约束","id":"全局约束"},{"level":3,"text":"N 皇后问题——CLP 的经典展示","id":"n-皇后问题-clp-的经典展示"},{"level":2,"text":"CLP(B)：布尔约束","id":"clp-b-布尔约束"},{"level":2,"text":"搜索策略：labeling 选项","id":"搜索策略-labeling-选项"},{"level":2,"text":"优化问题","id":"优化问题"},{"level":2,"text":"约束与纯逻辑编程的统一","id":"约束与纯逻辑编程的统一"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DCG 与语法解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/programming-techniques/dcg-parsing"},"next":{"title":"元编程与反射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/modern-prolog-programming/advanced-topics/meta-programming-reflection"}}